OL,3,ASix Flags shuts down X2 rollercoaster
OL,4,Aafter more than 100 allege brain
OL,5,Ainjuries
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix Flags Magic Mountain, an amusement
OL,8,Fpark in California, has announced it
OL,9,Fwill permanently close a popular
OL,10,Frollercoaster after more than 100
OL,11,Friders alleged they suffered brain
OL,12,Finjuries.
OL,14,FThe X2 rollercoaster, one of the park's
OL,15,Fmain attractions, with long wait times
OL,16,Fto ride and seats that spin 360
OL,17,Fdegrees, has been closed since July.
OL,19,FSix Flags said the ride had passed a
OL,20,Frange of safety tests, but that it had
OL,21,Fdecided to retire it because it was
OL,22,F"the right thing to do".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
