OL,3,ASix Flags shuts down X2 rollercoaster
OL,4,Aafter more than 100 allege brain
OL,5,Ainjuries
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe decision comes after lawsuits and
OL,8,Fnews reports alleged that riders
OL,9,Fsuffered brain injuries after riding
OL,10,FX2. A law firm representing some of the
OL,11,Fplaintiffs said the decision had come
OL,12,F"too late" for its clients.
